    "body": "## Summary\n- validate the selected FCM project ID before constructing the v1 send URL\n- allow only ASCII letters, digits, and hyphens, rejecting empty or malformed IDs before auth refresh or HTTP send\n- add coverage for malformed IDs from both config and service account fallback\n\n## Tests\n- just ci\n\nInternal security review follow-up.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Enhanced FCM project ID validation to reject empty or malformed IDs early with clear error messages, preventing downstream failures.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Extended test coverage for FCM project ID validation including scenarios with invalid configured and service account project IDs.\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/marmot-protocol/transponder/pull/54)\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
